{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2021-07-09 11:00:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK ANNOUNCES SCHEDULE FOR SECOND QUARTER 2021 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': "DALLAS, JULY 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION (NYSE: KMB) WILL ISSUE ITS SECOND QUARTER 2021 RESULTS ON FRIDAY, JULY 23 WITH A NEWS RELEASE ISSUED VIA PR NEWSWIRE AND FIRST CALL AT APPROXIMATELY 6:30 A.M. CDT. IN ADDITION TO THE NEWS RELEASE, THE COMPANY WILL MAKE AVAILABLE PREPARED MANAGEMENT REMARKS FROM KIMBERLY-CLARK'S CHAIRMAN AND CEO MIKE HSU AND SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CFO MARIA HENRY AT APPROXIMATELY 7 A.M."}